  "diffSummary": "每个伺服关节串联 ±1° 齿隙（共 2°）的被动铰链；编码器与关节观测读穿齿隙（BacklashEncoderBamActuator）。观测/动作维度不变，ONNX 与真机运行时无需改动。奖励按上游 microduck_ball_kick_env_cfg.py 逐项核对，共 12 项。",
  "verifiedAt": "2026-09-01",
  "verifiedRef": "pollen-robotics/microduck_rl@main · Mjlab-BallKick-Flat-Backlash-MicroDuck",
